{
    "title": "CoPilot shop/buy/sell used car",
    "description": "Shop with confidence with CoPilot\u2019s AI-Assisted car shopping app for new and used cars, trucks, minivans, SUVs, EVs & hybrids. CoPilot searches every car at every dealer, every day, pulls together all the information in one place, analyzes every car in seconds, and ranks them based on what matters to you.\r\n\r\nCar shopping can be overwhelming, but AI is a game changer. Let CoPilot AI do the hard work to find you the best car AND the best price. CoPilot is always on your side, and always 100% free.\r\n\r\nBuy with Confidence, with AI-Assisted Car Shopping\r\n- Never miss out on the best car\r\n- Never overpay\r\n- Never get taken advantage of\r\n\r\nAs featured in Bloomberg, CNN, CNBC, MarketWatch, NPR, New York Times, Forbes, TechCrunch, and Newsweek.\r\n\r\nHow Does CoPilot AI Assist?\r\n- All in one place: searches virtually every dealer\r\n- Powerful: analyzes millions of cars in seconds with unique data and insights\r\n- Personalized: ranks your perfect matches\r\n- Private: we never share your information\r\n- Always 100% Free!\r\n\r\nWhy join CoPilot?\r\n\r\nShopping \u2013 CoPilot AI does the work for you, 24/7:\r\n- Searches virtually every dealer so you don't have to\r\n- Analyzes every car with data and insights you won\u2019t find anywhere else\r\n- Ranks everything so it\u2019s always easy to find the best car at the best price\r\n- Unbiased: dealers can\u2019t pay to influence results\r\n\r\nBuying \u2013 Protect yourself with CoPilot on your side:\r\n- Avoid hidden fees\r\n- Get fair value for your trade-in\r\n- Don't overpay for a loan, warranty, or insurance\r\n\r\nOwning \u2013 Own your car with confidence: \r\n- Unlock hidden profit when you sell or trade in your car\r\n- Stay safe with alerts on recalls & maintenance\r\n- Save money on loans, insurance, and extended warranties with discounted rates for CoPilot members\r\n\r\nCoPilot takes the stress out of car-buying. There\u2019s no trick prices or bait-and-switch tactics, just simplified, unbiased, AI-driven insights on each car, and what the Carfax means. CoPilot is independent, honest, and always 100% free. Not just a free trial, but a truly free app. No upsells or premium subscriptions.\r\n\r\nIf it\u2019s free, how does CoPilot make money?\r\n\r\nUnlike other apps, dealers can\u2019t pay to influence CoPilot\u2019s results. And we don\u2019t sell your information, nor show ads or sponsored listings. We only get paid when we save you money on important car-related purchases, like insurance, loans, or warranties from the most trusted partners.\r\n\r\nHow does CoPilot work?\r\n\r\n 1. Tell your CoPilot AI Assistant the type of car you\u2019re interested in, and your must-have or nice-to-have features.\r\n 2. We\u2019ll compare and rank new and pre-owned cars for sale at virtually every US dealer 24/7 to find the best cars that match what matters most to you.\r\n 3. Whenever new cars are listed for sale that match your preferences, we\u2019ll find them and you\u2019ll be first to know. You may discover a feature-loaded, low mileage car at a 5-star dealer you never knew existed! Using data that dealers would prefer to keep secret, we calculate the true car value, showing you the \u201cA\u201d buys. Most people are not car gurus, so we highlight the Pros and Cons, simplifying the technical specs and the vehicle history report, all in one place. And we provide tips to empower you to buy your perfect ride and feel great about it.\r\n\r\nSo download the free app and let CoPilot AI do the work! We show you the SUV, crossover, wagon, sedan, minivan, convertible, coupe, van or truck that matches your preferences (but not caravans, RVs, or bikes). From Audi to Subaru or Toyota; BMW or Ford, Chevrolet or Chrysler, Honda, Kia, or Tesla, your next car is out there. CoPilot AI will find it for you. Our car ratings and dealer reviews tell you what, where, and when to buy \u2026 or why you should wait. Dealer-paid apps never do that!\r\n\r\nGetting a new car is exciting! Discover the fun of the find with none of the grind, as CoPilot puts intelligent car shopping in your pocket.\r\n\r\nGet the CoPilot app today and never buy solo again!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shop with confidence with CoPilot\u2019s AI-Assisted car shopping app for new and used cars, trucks, minivans, SUVs, EVs &amp; hybrids. CoPilot searches every car at every dealer, every day, pulls together all the information in one place, analyzes every car in seconds, and ranks them based on what matters to you.<br><br>Car shopping can be overwhelming, but AI is a game changer. Let CoPilot AI do the hard work to find you the best car AND the best price. CoPilot is always on your side, and always 100% free.<br><br>Buy with Confidence, with AI-Assisted Car Shopping<br>- Never miss out on the best car<br>- Never overpay<br>- Never get taken advantage of<br><br>As featured in Bloomberg, CNN, CNBC, MarketWatch, NPR, New York Times, Forbes, TechCrunch, and Newsweek.<br><br>How Does CoPilot AI Assist?<br>- All in one place: searches virtually every dealer<br>- Powerful: analyzes millions of cars in seconds with unique data and insights<br>- Personalized: ranks your perfect matches<br>- Private: we never share your information<br>- Always 100% Free!<br><br>Why join CoPilot?<br><br>Shopping \u2013 CoPilot AI does the work for you, 24/7:<br>- Searches virtually every dealer so you don&#39;t have to<br>- Analyzes every car with data and insights you won\u2019t find anywhere else<br>- Ranks everything so it\u2019s always easy to find the best car at the best price<br>- Unbiased: dealers can\u2019t pay to influence results<br><br>Buying \u2013 Protect yourself with CoPilot on your side:<br>- Avoid hidden fees<br>- Get fair value for your trade-in<br>- Don&#39;t overpay for a loan, warranty, or insurance<br><br>Owning \u2013 Own your car with confidence: <br>- Unlock hidden profit when you sell or trade in your car<br>- Stay safe with alerts on recalls &amp; maintenance<br>- Save money on loans, insurance, and extended warranties with discounted rates for CoPilot members<br><br>CoPilot takes the stress out of car-buying. There\u2019s no trick prices or bait-and-switch tactics, just simplified, unbiased, AI-driven insights on each car, and what the Carfax means. CoPilot is independent, honest, and always 100% free. Not just a free trial, but a truly free app. No upsells or premium subscriptions.<br><br>If it\u2019s free, how does CoPilot make money?<br><br>Unlike other apps, dealers can\u2019t pay to influence CoPilot\u2019s results. And we don\u2019t sell your information, nor show ads or sponsored listings. We only get paid when we save you money on important car-related purchases, like insurance, loans, or warranties from the most trusted partners.<br><br>How does CoPilot work?<br><br> 1. Tell your CoPilot AI Assistant the type of car you\u2019re interested in, and your must-have or nice-to-have features.<br> 2. We\u2019ll compare and rank new and pre-owned cars for sale at virtually every US dealer 24/7 to find the best cars that match what matters most to you.<br> 3. Whenever new cars are listed for sale that match your preferences, we\u2019ll find them and you\u2019ll be first to know. You may discover a feature-loaded, low mileage car at a 5-star dealer you never knew existed! Using data that dealers would prefer to keep secret, we calculate the true car value, showing you the \u201cA\u201d buys. Most people are not car gurus, so we highlight the Pros and Cons, simplifying the technical specs and the vehicle history report, all in one place. And we provide tips to empower you to buy your perfect ride and feel great about it.<br><br>So download the free app and let CoPilot AI do the work! We show you the SUV, crossover, wagon, sedan, minivan, convertible, coupe, van or truck that matches your preferences (but not caravans, RVs, or bikes). From Audi to Subaru or Toyota; BMW or Ford, Chevrolet or Chrysler, Honda, Kia, or Tesla, your next car is out there. CoPilot AI will find it for you. Our car ratings and dealer reviews tell you what, where, and when to buy \u2026 or why you should wait. Dealer-paid apps never do that!<br><br>Getting a new car is exciting! Discover the fun of the find with none of the grind, as CoPilot puts intelligent car shopping in your pocket.<br><br>Get the CoPilot app today and never buy solo again!",
